{"id":"0fb569bc36cce327","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-valuation.md","title":"Valuation","display":"df-valuation — Valuation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-valuation","aliases":["58-df-valuation","Valuation"],"display":"df-valuation — Valuation","depends_on":["[[58-df-field]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-total-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-valuation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-valuation</span><span>Valuation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-valuation — Valuation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f54a13cf4872f4e\" href=\"?note=9f54a13cf4872f4e\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md\">../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"043908345fb04de3\" href=\"?note=043908345fb04de3\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-total-order.md\">../batch20/58-df-total-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v,K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\Gamma,+_\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma\\in V\">\\(v,K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\Gamma,+_\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\)</span> (field predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(\\Gamma,+_\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(\\Gamma,+_\\Gamma)\\)</span> (abelian-group predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9f54a13cf4872f4e\" href=\"?note=9f54a13cf4872f4e\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md\">../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma)\\)</span> (total-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"043908345fb04de3\" href=\"?note=043908345fb04de3\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-total-order.md\">../batch20/58-df-total-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Valuation}_S\\subseteq V^9\\cup V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Valuation}_S\\subseteq V^9\\cup V^3\\)</span> (precise predicate and compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valuation}\\vdash\\mathrm{Valuation}_S(v,K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\Gamma,+_\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(\\Gamma,+_\\Gamma)\\land\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in\\Gamma\\;\\bigl(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\leq_\\Gamma\\to\\langle +_\\Gamma(\\langle a,c\\rangle),+_\\Gamma(\\langle b,c\\rangle)\\rangle\\in\\leq_\\Gamma\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(v,K\\setminus\\{0_K\\},\\Gamma)\\land\\forall x,y\\in K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}\\;\\bigl(v(\\cdot_K(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=+_\\Gamma(\\langle v(x),v(y)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}\\;\\Bigl(+_K(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\neq0_K\\to\\bigl[(\\langle v(x),v(y)\\rangle\\in\\leq_\\Gamma\\land\\langle v(x),v(+_K(\\langle x,y\\rangle))\\rangle\\in\\leq_\\Gamma)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{49mm}\\lor(\\langle v(y),v(x)\\rangle\\in\\leq_\\Gamma\\land\\langle v(y),v(+_K(\\langle x,y\\rangle))\\rangle\\in\\leq_\\Gamma)\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valuation}\\vdash\\mathrm{Valuation}_S(v,K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\Gamma,+_\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(\\Gamma,+_\\Gamma)\\land\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in\\Gamma\\;\\bigl(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\leq_\\Gamma\\to\\langle +_\\Gamma(\\langle a,c\\rangle),+_\\Gamma(\\langle b,c\\rangle)\\rangle\\in\\leq_\\Gamma\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(v,K\\setminus\\{0_K\\},\\Gamma)\\land\\forall x,y\\in K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}\\;\\bigl(v(\\cdot_K(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=+_\\Gamma(\\langle v(x),v(y)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}\\;\\Bigl(+_K(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\neq0_K\\to\\bigl[(\\langle v(x),v(y)\\rangle\\in\\leq_\\Gamma\\land\\langle v(x),v(+_K(\\langle x,y\\rangle))\\rangle\\in\\leq_\\Gamma)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{49mm}\\lor(\\langle v(y),v(x)\\rangle\\in\\leq_\\Gamma\\land\\langle v(y),v(+_K(\\langle x,y\\rangle))\\rangle\\in\\leq_\\Gamma)\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valuation\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\\mathrm{Valuation}_S(v,K,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,+_\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Valuation}_S(v,K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\Gamma,+_\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valuation\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\\mathrm{Valuation}_S(v,K,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,+_\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Valuation}_S(v,K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\Gamma,+_\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The field operations and constants, value-group operation, total order, and translation-invariance law are explicit.  The ultrametric inequality is expanded without an undefined <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min\">\\(\\min\\)</span> operator.</li>\n<li>For <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c&gt;1\">\\(c&gt;1\\)</span>, the associated non-Archimedean absolute value is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|x|_v=c^{-v(x)}\">\\(|x|_v=c^{-v(x)}\\)</span> (or equivalently use a base <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;c&lt;1\">\\(0&lt;c&lt;1\\)</span> with exponent <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v(x)\">\\(v(x)\\)</span>).</li>\n<li>The valuation ring <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{O}_v\">\\(\\mathcal{O}_v\\)</span>, maximal ideal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{m}_v\">\\(\\mathfrak{m}_v\\)</span>, and residue field <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k_v\">\\(k_v\\)</span> are derived constructions.</li>\n<li>Discrete: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v: K^\\times \\to \\mathbb{Z}\">\\(v: K^\\times \\to \\mathbb{Z}\\)</span> gives DVR (discrete valuation ring); PID local</li>\n<li>Non-archimedean: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v(x+y) \\geq \\min(v(x), v(y))\">\\(v(x+y) \\geq \\min(v(x), v(y))\\)</span>; ultrametric triangle inequality</li>\n<li>Extension: valuations extend to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L/K\">\\(L/K\\)</span> uniquely up to conjugacy for henselian</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Neukirch, Algebraic Number Theory</li>\n<li>Engler and Prestel, Valued Fields</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-field]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f54a13cf4872f4e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-total-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"043908345fb04de3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-total-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Field}_S$ (field predicate, see [[58-df-field]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f54a13cf4872f4e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(\\Gamma,+_\\Gamma)$ (abelian-group predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-total-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"043908345fb04de3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma)$ (total-order predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-total-order.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"v,K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\Gamma,+_\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(\\Gamma,+_\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Valuation}_S\\subseteq V^9\\cup V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valuation}\\vdash\\mathrm{Valuation}_S(v,K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\Gamma,+_\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(\\Gamma,+_\\Gamma)\\land\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in\\Gamma\\;\\bigl(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\leq_\\Gamma\\to\\langle +_\\Gamma(\\langle a,c\\rangle),+_\\Gamma(\\langle b,c\\rangle)\\rangle\\in\\leq_\\Gamma\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(v,K\\setminus\\{0_K\\},\\Gamma)\\land\\forall x,y\\in K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}\\;\\bigl(v(\\cdot_K(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=+_\\Gamma(\\langle v(x),v(y)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}\\;\\Bigl(+_K(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\neq0_K\\to\\bigl[(\\langle v(x),v(y)\\rangle\\in\\leq_\\Gamma\\land\\langle v(x),v(+_K(\\langle x,y\\rangle))\\rangle\\in\\leq_\\Gamma)\\\\\n&\\hspace{49mm}\\lor(\\langle v(y),v(x)\\rangle\\in\\leq_\\Gamma\\land\\langle v(y),v(+_K(\\langle x,y\\rangle))\\rangle\\in\\leq_\\Gamma)\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mat